<section id="examples" class="wrap section">
  <div class="section-top">
    <span class="index">02 / IN GOOD COMPANY</span>
    <span class="mono muted">ILLUSTRATIVE APP SAMPLES</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Not just a pretty swatch.</h2>
    <p>The same decisions, carried across code, command lines and everyday interfaces.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="sample-toolbar">
    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Application samples">
      <button id="tab-editor" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="sample-editor" data-tab="editor">Editor</button>
      <button id="tab-terminal" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sample-terminal" data-tab="terminal">Terminal</button>
      <button id="tab-interface" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sample-interface" data-tab="interface">Interface</button>
    </div>
    <span class="mono muted">SOLAI / <span class="current-name">TIDE</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="app-window">
    <div class="window-chrome">
      <span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span>
      <span id="window-title">a-small-moment.ts</span>
      <span>⌘</span>
    </div>
    <div id="sample-editor" class="sample editor" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-editor">
      <aside class="filetree">
        <span class="mono muted">EXPLORER</span>
        <div>⌄ solai</div>
        <div class="selected">▧ a-small-moment.ts</div>
        <div>▧ palette.json</div>
        <div>▧ README.md</div>
        <small>A little less noise.<br />A little more focus.</small>
      </aside>
      <div class="code-area">
        <div class="code-title">a-small-moment.ts <span>●</span></div>
        <pre is:raw><code><span class="line"><i>01</i><span class="comment">// A softer place to make things.</span></span><span class="line"><i>02</i><span class="keyword">import</span> { createTheme } <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="string">'solai'</span>;</span><span class="line"><i>03</i></span><span class="line"><i>04</i><span class="keyword">const</span> atmosphere: <span class="type">Theme</span> = createTheme({</span><span class="line"><i>05</i>  name: <span class="string">'<span class="current-name-lower">tide</span>'</span>,</span><span class="line focus-line"><i>06</i>  background: <span class="string canvas-hex">'#101416'</span>,</span><span class="line"><i>07</i>  accent: <span class="string accent-hex">'#00ACCE'</span>,</span><span class="line"><i>08</i>  noise: <span class="number">0.02</span>,</span><span class="line"><i>09</i>  gentle: <span class="number">true</span>,</span><span class="line"><i>10</i>});</span><span class="line"><i>11</i></span><span class="line"><i>12</i><span class="keyword">export default</span> atmosphere;<span class="cursor">▏</span></span></code></pre>
        <div class="code-status">
          <span>main* &nbsp; ✓ 0 problems</span>
          <span>TypeScript · UTF-8</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="sample-terminal" class="sample terminal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-terminal" hidden>
      <p class="term-muted">Last login: a quiet evening</p>
      <p><span class="term-green">~/studio</span> <span class="accent">❯</span> solai inspect --flavour <span class="current-name-lower">tide</span></p>
      <p class="terminal-logo">s o l a i <span>✳</span></p>
      <p>Palette loaded. Make yourself at home.</p>
      <div class="term-facts">
        <span class="accent">Theme</span><span class="current-name">Tide</span>
        <span class="accent">Colours</span><span>17 ramps / 11 steps</span>
        <span class="accent">Character</span><span>Near-neutral. Clear at heart.</span>
      </div>
      <div id="ansi-swatches" class="ansi-swatches" aria-label="Proposed terminal ANSI colours"></div>
      <p><span class="term-green">✓</span> Core contrast pairs checked</p>
      <p><span class="term-yellow">!</span> Terminal mappings are proposals, not installed ports</p>
      <p><span class="term-green">~/studio</span> <span class="accent">❯</span> <span class="cursor">▊</span></p>
    </div>
    <div id="sample-interface" class="sample settings" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-interface" hidden>
      <aside>
        <span class="mono muted">YOUR SPACE</span>
        <h3>A quieter workspace.</h3>
        <p>A small interface specimen. These controls are local demonstrations.</p>
        <div class="mini-art" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
      </aside>
      <div class="settings-content">
        <h3>Appearance</h3>
        <label class="setting-row">
          <span><strong>Soft focus</strong><small>Keep the important things in view</small></span>
          <input type="checkbox" checked role="switch" aria-label="Soft focus" />
        </label>
        <label class="setting-row">
          <span><strong>Comfortable spacing</strong><small>A little extra room to breathe</small></span>
          <input type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="Comfortable spacing" />
        </label>
        <label class="input-label" for="workspace-name">Workspace name</label>
        <input id="workspace-name" type="text" value="A small corner of the internet" maxlength="80" />
        <div class="status-row">
          <span class="badge success">✓ Saved</span>
          <span class="badge warning">! Review</span>
          <span class="badge danger">× Error</span>
          <span class="badge info">i Note</span>
        </div>
        <div class="action-row">
          <button class="primary" id="save-demo">Save changes</button>
          <button class="secondary" id="reset-demo">Reset</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="sample-note">A design specimen, not a shipping application. Syntax keeps Dolch’s restrained character; status colours keep their meaning.</p>
</section>
